{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Google 正為旗下 AI 編碼工具 Antigravity 推送 Gemini 4 Argon 支援。Argon 是 Google 最新的旗艦 AI 模型，於九月底公佈，並在本週較早時已廣泛推送給用戶。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/323c5162874cbfb57cf15375c4ab0129cbd5b452403f2aa2f2add0953b7dd13a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fd7095a4e2e097e80440a2045f8fbf364\"/><h3>Antigravity 開始推送 Argon</h3><p>Google 將 Antigravity 描述為代理式開發平台，利用 AI 與代理協助編寫程式碼及建構應用程式。Google 本週較早時公佈 Argon 會在 Antigravity 提供，現時已正式向 AI Pro 及 AI Ultra 訂閱者推送，功能亦已在實際環境中上線。</p><p>Google 在 X 的帖文中補充，在 Gemini 3.8 Flash 的既有配額之上，另設「每週專用的 Argon 配額」，用戶可按需要選用最合適的模型。Google 表示，Argon「旨在處理你最棘手的問題」。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f18f29e93cfcca0443fcc8c3caaf59f0dbdd7bc60410d61df7e7e5c998b618d4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fa53161e0d945487fa093d7260880b617\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T16:16:22.221417+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":2,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T06:18:02.267019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:14:39.825981+00:00","content_hash":"804260c9876306361111aa6348a22da2f7684628c401c58e05000ca68f5aa8b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}